		{"id":"41ce2c7ce558c53a","type":"text","text":"Technical Director\n│\n├── Lead Server Engineer\n│   ├── Server Devs\n│   ├── API Devs\n│   └── DB Engineer\n│\n├── Lead Client Engineer\n│   └── Client Devs\n│\n├── Lead Network Engineer\n│   └── Network Devs\n│\n├── Lead DevOps / SRE\n│   ├── SREs\n│   └── Sysadmins\n│\n└── Lead QA Engineer (технический)\n    ├── Backend QA\n    ├── Performance QA\n    └── Automation QA","x":-3720,"y":280,"width":250,"height":440}
